{"statementName": "native", "string": "kg_ss         = (beta * A_ss / (1 - beta))^exp1 * ( (1 - tauk_ss) * alpha - x_y)^exp1 * (( (1 - alpha) * (1 - tauw_ss)*A_ss ) / (omega * (1 + tauc_ss)) )^exp2 * (xg_y * A_ss / deltag)^exp3;                         "},
{"statementName": "native", "string": "k_n           = (beta / (1 - beta) * ((1 - tauk_ss) * alpha - x_y) * A_ss * kg_ss^alpha1)^(1 / (1 - alpha));"},
